## Combined Visual Studio / Microsoft Office / JetBrains Blacklist
## Objective: Ignore built binaries, cache files, and user-specific settings

# --- Visual Studio Artifacts ---
# User-specific files (Layout, opened files, history)
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/

# Built outputs (الفايلات اللي بتنتج عن الـ Build)
[Dd]ebug/
[Debug_AnyCPU/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Aa]rm/
[Aa]rm64/
bbin/
bin/
obj/

# --- Tools & IDEs ---
# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Rider / JetBrains
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# --- Operating System Files ---
# Windows thumbnail database
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Secrets & Environment (مهم جداً للأمان) ---
# Don't commit production secrets!
.env
.env.local
appsettings.Production.json